        "name": "Acclimated Mount",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>By the grace of your god, your mount can overcome the natural challenges and hazards present in a specific terrain. Choose aquatic, arctic, desert, forest, mountain, plains, sky, swamp, or underground. Your mount must have a swim Speed to select aquatic, and a fly Speed to select sky. Your mount ignores the effects of difficult terrain while in the selected terrain.</p>\n<p>If you become an expert in Survival, you can pray during your daily preparations each day to change the type of terrain to which your mount is acclimated.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 4
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "Faithful Steed"
              },
              {
                "value": "trained in Survival"
              }
            ]
          },
